Package: super-v
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Super V maintainers <super-v@localhost>
Depends: xclip | xsel, gnome-screenshot, libnotify-bin, libgl1, libx11-6, libxrandr2, libxinerama1, libxcursor1, libxi6, libxxf86vm1, libwayland-client0
Description: clipboard history and screenshot shortcuts for Linux
 Super V provides a local clipboard history popup and global screenshot
 shortcuts for Linux Mint Cinnamon on X11.
